      "description": "­ Job Seeker Resources | Cornell College Skip Navigation. Students Faculty/Staff Parents/Families Alumni Give About Academics Admission Financial Aid Athletics Student Life Virtual Tour Menu Search Search Search About Students Academics Faculty & Staff Admission Parents & Families Financial Aid Alumni Athletics Give Virtual Tour Student Life Transfer Cornell on Facebook Cornell on Twitter Cornell on Instagram Cornell on Flickr Cornell on Youtube Search Search Search Directory search Campus calendar Academic calendar Dining Cole Library Bookstore Cornell on Facebook Cornell on Twitter Cornell on Instagram Cornell on Flickr Cornell on Youtube Job Seeker Resources Human Resources Menu Additional Navigation holidays Our Services Contact Us Benefits Compensation & Payroll Employee Relations & Supervisor Resources Purple Rock Hall of Fame Employee Handbook & College Policies Employment Background Check Policy Job Seeker Resources Interested in a position at Cornell College? Please visit the following resources to obtain more information regarding Mount Vernon, Iowa and visiting the campus. Visiting Cornell College, Mount Vernon, and surrounding areas About Mount Vernon and the Region ICR Iowa Mount Vernon-Lisbon Community Development City of Mount Vernon City of Cedar Rapids Think Iowa City Events Working & living in Mount Vernon Mount Vernon Community School District Jobs in the Area Cornell is an affirmative action/equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating a diverse workforce. In compliance with federal and state laws, Cornell employs and promotes personnel without discrimination because of race, color, sex, sexual orientation, religion, age, national origin, or disability. Cornell College complies with Iowa's Smoke Free Air Act. Request Info Visit Cornell Apply Now Cookie Policy Cornell College asks you to accept cookies for authorization purposes,\n\t\t\t\t    as well as to track usage data and for marketing purposes. To get more information about these cookies and the processing of your personal information, please see our Privacy Policy . Do you accept these cookies and the\n\t\t\t\t    processing of your personal information involved? Accept all cookies Necessary cookies only Cornell shield Support Cornell Cornell College 600 First Street SW Mount Vernon, IA 52314 319.895.4000 Contact Cornell Visitor Info Cole Library Campus Calendar News Jobs Emergencies Consumer Info & Accreditation Directory Privacy Policy Web Accessibility Web Feedback Site Map CTCL Logo Cornell College admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally accorded or made available to students. Cornell does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. © 2026  Cornell College. All rights reserved."
